  "description": "Jev-supervised madmax conductor for pi: tiny slices, parallel pi-subagents workers in worktrees, TypeSafe Jev makes routing, review, QA and supervision decisions.",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Damian Borek",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/damian87x/jev-pi-orchestrator#readme",
